# Quick manual checks (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client). Run the API first.
@api = http://localhost:5080

### Catalog grouped by category
GET {{api}}/api/catalog

### Mobility
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/stops?q=rondo&page=1&pageSize=20
###
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/stops/nearby?lat=50.0614&lon=19.9372&radius=600
###
# Sample-mode stop id; live ids look like T:123 or A:456 (URL-encode the colon as %3A if needed)
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/stops/S:3/departures?limit=10&windowMinutes=60
###
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/routes?mode=tram
###
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/vehicles
###
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/trip-updates?minDelaySeconds=180
###
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/alerts
###
GET {{api}}/api/mobility/park-and-ride

### Environment
GET {{api}}/api/environment/weather
###
GET {{api}}/api/environment/air-quality

### Climate & crisis
GET {{api}}/api/crisis/river-gauges?elevatedOnly=true
###
GET {{api}}/api/crisis/warnings?teryt=1261

### Urban space
GET {{api}}/api/urban/districts

### Public services
GET {{api}}/api/services/cards?q=msip
###
GET {{api}}/api/services/waiting-lists?benefit=ortoped&urgent=false

### City Open Data portal (api.um.krakow.pl)
GET {{api}}/api/open-data/tables
###
GET {{api}}/api/open-data/tables?category=Society
###
GET {{api}}/api/open-data/tables/nurseries-public?limit=100
###
GET {{api}}/api/open-data/tables/lost-property?q=telefon
###
GET {{api}}/api/urban/amenities?kind=Defibrillator&lat=50.0617&lon=19.9373&radius=1000
###
GET {{api}}/api/urban/street-lights?lat=50.0617&lon=19.9373&radius=300
###
GET {{api}}/api/urban/street-lights/summary?lat=50.0617&lon=19.9373&radius=1000
